WEBVTT

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:45.480
Father

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:46.319
A Lan

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:48.840
What's so urgent that you're looking for Father?

00:01:49.599 --> 00:01:50.480
Nothing major.

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:51.519
By the way,

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:53.640
Why did you send Yuwen Rui to Yu Zhen?

00:01:55.079 --> 00:01:57.040
There's a lead on the Sword Maniac in Yu Zhen.

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:58.599
I sent him to investigate.

00:01:59.040 --> 00:01:59.359
What?
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:00.640
You'll miss him?

00:02:01.239 --> 00:02:01.879
Of course not.

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:06.439
I heard you've been pestering Grand Tutor Guan lately.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:08.120
And even sneaking out of the palace to see him.

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:10.400
Your daughter noticed Grand Tutor Guan

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.919
has seemed troubled recently.

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:12.960
I wanted to cheer him up.

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:16.159
Why don't I see you trying to cheer your father up?

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:18.960
Your daughter actually has a big matter

00:02:19.039 --> 00:02:20.960
to make Father happy.

00:02:31.319 --> 00:02:31.919
Princess.

00:02:32.159 --> 00:02:35.159
The vendor said this Beauty Powder must be dissolved in water.

00:02:35.479 --> 00:02:36.879
Should I put it in the tea now?

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:39.479
Princess?

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:41.759
Go ahead.

00:03:03.319 --> 00:03:04.560
Lord Yuwen will be here soon.

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:06.400
This servant will go prepare some snacks.

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:19.000
Lord Yuwen.

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:20.840
My lord departs the capital tomorrow.

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.680
You must have much to discuss with the princess.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:23.800
I have given orders

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.039
to ensure no one disturbs you.

00:03:25.919 --> 00:03:26.840
My lord, please go in.

00:03:27.159 --> 00:03:29.759
The princess has specially prepared a big gift for you.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:30.680
A big gift?

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:39.800
My Lord.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:40.719
These past days,

00:03:41.039 --> 00:03:42.639
our people have been searching everywhere for the Sword Maniac.

00:03:43.039 --> 00:03:44.400
We finally found his trail

00:03:44.879 --> 00:03:46.840
and seized the final key.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.120
As you ordered,

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:56.759
I had people spread

00:03:56.759 --> 00:03:58.400
the false rumor of the Sword Maniac being in Yu Zhen.

00:03:59.199 --> 00:04:00.080
Just as you predicted,

00:04:00.599 --> 00:04:02.639
the Yunmi emperor has ordered Yuwen Rui

00:04:02.759 --> 00:04:03.680
to go to Yu Zhen.

00:04:07.599 --> 00:04:08.400
Is everything arranged?

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:12.520
Death squad members are already positioned along the route.

00:04:13.199 --> 00:04:14.360
They will surely ensure Yuwen Rui

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:16.120
never returns.

00:04:25.399 --> 00:04:26.160
Spare his life.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.560
Just make sure he cannot return to Luo Jing.

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:29.279
My Lord,

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:29.920
this...

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:31.079
What?

00:04:31.959 --> 00:04:33.160
Are my words not effective?

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:37.560
This subordinate wouldn't dare.

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:40.680
My Lord,

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:43.720
the Fifth Princess has been persistently bothering Grand Tutor Guan lately.

00:04:44.399 --> 00:04:46.079
Could she have discovered something?

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:50.480
If she had discovered anything,

00:04:51.959 --> 00:04:53.120
it wouldn't be so calm.

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:58.319
What time do you leave tomorrow?

00:04:58.920 --> 00:04:59.399
At Chen hour.

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:06.639
Aphrodisiac Powder?

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:10.360
This... this tea...

00:05:11.439 --> 00:05:12.439
Does it taste strange?

00:05:12.839 --> 00:05:14.920
You told Xixi to add something special.

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:18.120
You had Xixi add it?

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:21.199
For me to drink?

00:05:21.399 --> 00:05:22.279
Obviously.

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:23.480
Aren't you drinking it right now?

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:29.480
I heard

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.519
you prepared a big gift.

00:05:32.639 --> 00:05:33.639
Xixi told you?

00:05:34.399 --> 00:05:35.079
Where's the gift?

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:37.360
Far away on the horizon,

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:38.319
yet right before your eyes.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:49.600
If all goes well,

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:50.639
I'll be back soon.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:53.279
You didn't need to prepare such a grand gift.

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:54.720
Of course it's necessary.

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:56.600
Hurry up and unwrap the gift.

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:09.680
Perhaps the gift should be unwrapped another day.

00:06:10.879 --> 00:06:12.120
Why not now?

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:14.319
Are you sure?

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:16.879
I'm sure.

00:06:17.399 --> 00:06:18.160
No regrets?

00:06:19.319 --> 00:06:21.040
What's there to regret about this?

00:06:25.079 --> 00:06:25.519
Fine.

00:06:26.959 --> 00:06:27.680
As you wish.

00:06:32.439 --> 00:06:33.079
What are you doing?

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:34.160
Unwrapping the gift.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.839
Yuwen Rui, you're acting strange.

00:06:41.399 --> 00:06:42.600
You're the one acting strange.

00:06:43.279 --> 00:06:43.720
Me?

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:55.279
What's wrong with you?

00:06:56.759 --> 00:06:58.519
You put Aphrodisiac Powder in the tea.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:06:59.759
And you ask what's wrong with me?

00:07:00.199 --> 00:07:00.879
Aphrodisiac Powder?

00:07:01.639 --> 00:07:02.839
Wasn't that Beauty Powder?

00:07:04.439 --> 00:07:05.680
The free sample must have been mixed up.

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:08.519
Are you okay?

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:10.240
What do you think?

00:07:11.879 --> 00:07:12.800
In cheesy TV dramas,

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:14.319
the aphrodisiac plot is always there.

00:07:17.519 --> 00:07:18.399
What do we do now?

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.399
Calm down first.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.040
How am I supposed to calm down?

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.679
It really is red.

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:06.559
What are you doing?

00:09:06.559 --> 00:09:07.799
Put me down!

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:12.080
Where's the wound medicine?

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:17.159
You don't actually think

00:09:17.159 --> 00:09:18.440
I wanted to do something to you, do you?

00:09:25.399 --> 00:09:26.559
I don't want you to feel

00:09:27.639 --> 00:09:29.200
you aren't cherished.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.279
If this were a TV show,

00:09:33.879 --> 00:09:35.840
the comments would only question you.

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:39.039
It's nothing.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:40.679
The wound medicine.

00:09:42.519 --> 00:09:43.000
It's fine.

00:09:43.279 --> 00:09:44.279
Just a minor bump.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:26.399
Get some rest early.

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:36.120
It's quite late.

00:10:36.679 --> 00:10:38.200
You have to travel early tomorrow.

00:10:40.759 --> 00:10:42.360
Stay and rest here tonight.

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:51.759
Once everything is settled,

00:10:52.879 --> 00:10:54.759
I will request permission for us to marry soon.

00:10:56.759 --> 00:10:57.399
There's no hurry.

00:10:58.159 --> 00:10:59.519
Things are fine as they are now.

00:11:00.879 --> 00:11:01.720
What do you mean no hurry?

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:04.000
I've been waiting all this time.

00:11:12.759 --> 00:11:13.240
Sleep.

00:11:26.039 --> 00:11:27.720
This is a protective talisman I made for you myself.

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:44.440
Wait for me to return.

00:11:46.759 --> 00:11:47.519
Stop being so lovey-dovey.

00:11:48.039 --> 00:11:48.639
Yu Zhen isn't far.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.600
Big brother will be back in five days at most.

00:11:54.519 --> 00:11:55.159
By the way, big brother,

00:11:55.519 --> 00:11:57.360
A Zi is busy with the Celestial Rite preparations.

00:11:57.840 --> 00:11:58.639
She asked me to pass on a message.

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:00.480
She wishes you a safe journey.

00:12:03.879 --> 00:12:05.440
I'll take a detour via Qi Zhen to Yu Zhen.

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:06.879
It might delay me by two days.

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:13.639
Take care of yourself.

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:38.559
I'm afraid it's a one-way trip.

00:12:40.799 --> 00:12:41.960
I came to see A Lan.

00:12:42.159 --> 00:12:43.360
I'm definitely not here to see you.

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:45.519
I know.

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:47.480
You came to find the Fifth Princess

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:50.080
and just happened to see me.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:00.799
From now on,

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:03.519
I...

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:07.960
I... can I call you Yinglu?

00:13:14.039 --> 00:13:14.519
Yinglu.

00:13:18.919 --> 00:13:19.720
Can I...

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:21.960
give you a hug?

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:47.039
Yinglu.

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:49.120
A Lan.

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:51.320
What have you been up to since you got back?

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:53.120
You didn't even come find me.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:53.960
I missed you so much!

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:55.080
I missed you too.

00:13:55.360 --> 00:13:56.480
There's been so much going on lately.

00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:58.600
But,

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:00.120
it seems like you've

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:02.080
been busy with other things too.

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:07.559
Why is Commander He here too?

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:10.200
You two...

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:11.120
We...

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:13.440
We...

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:15.519
ran into each other

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:17.720
by coincidence.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:20.480
Fifth Princess,

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:22.519
this humble official will take his leave.

00:14:23.399 --> 00:14:24.000
Commander He,

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:24.559
wait.

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:26.320
There's something I want to ask you.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:30.960
Commander He,

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.080
do you have a woman you like?

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:41.200
No.

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:44.159
That's great!

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:46.159
The legitimate daughter of the Xia Residence

00:14:46.159 --> 00:14:47.240
told me just yesterday

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:48.200
that she admires Commander He

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:49.360
and will marry no one but him.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.960
Miss Xia has exceptional grace

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:52.799
and is gentle and lovely.

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:55.519
Commander He isn't getting any younger either.

00:14:55.639 --> 00:14:57.399
How about I play matchmaker?

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:02.600
This humble official... I am of lowly status and scant fortune.

00:15:03.039 --> 00:15:03.960
How could I possibly...

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:05.799
What's all this "lowly status and scant fortune"?

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:07.639
Commander He is young

00:15:07.639 --> 00:15:08.679
and already the Commander of the Imperial Guard.

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:10.679
No wonder Miss Xia

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:11.960
insists on marrying you.

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:14.360
Alright then,

00:15:14.799 --> 00:15:16.240
I'll go find Father right now

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:17.240
to arrange your marriage.

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:17.679
How about that?

00:15:18.159 --> 00:15:18.559
A Lan!

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:22.759
What?

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.039
I...

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:27.600
I understand.

00:15:29.399 --> 00:15:31.399
Yinglu has reached marriageable age too.

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:35.200
Oh!

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:36.440
Let me tell you,

00:15:36.639 --> 00:15:38.679
this Miss Xia has an older brother

00:15:38.879 --> 00:15:40.000
who is also an outstanding man.

00:15:40.639 --> 00:15:41.679
If you're willing,

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:43.440
Commander He might one day

00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:45.080
have to call you "sister-in-law."

00:15:46.639 --> 00:15:47.919
Who wants to be his sister-in-law?!

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:49.960
Don't get so worked up.

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:50.559
I...

00:15:52.519 --> 00:15:52.960
I...

00:15:54.279 --> 00:15:54.879
Alright, alright.

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:55.919
I get it.

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:57.080
Then I'll help you

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:58.519
look for other men.

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:00.399
Commander He,

00:16:00.759 --> 00:16:02.879
Miss Xia is truly as beautiful as a fairy.

00:16:02.879 --> 00:16:03.879
I guarantee once you see her,

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:05.200
you'll fall for her at first sight.

00:16:05.679 --> 00:16:06.200
Fifth Princess,

00:16:06.639 --> 00:16:08.759
actually, this humble official already has someone he likes.

00:16:08.919 --> 00:16:09.799
Don't lie.

00:16:09.799 --> 00:16:10.919
You just said you didn't.

00:16:11.639 --> 00:16:12.960
Don't be shy.

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:13.879
Let's go.

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:14.559
Don't be shy.

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.240
The person he likes is me.

00:16:27.039 --> 00:16:27.679
Commander He,

00:16:28.399 --> 00:16:28.919
you're welcome.

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:31.279
A Lan!

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:32.919
You actually tricked me!

00:16:33.519 --> 00:16:34.639
You lied to me first.

00:16:34.759 --> 00:16:35.840
How dare you criticize me?

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:36.639
When did you and Lord Yuwen

00:16:36.639 --> 00:16:37.519
get together?

00:16:38.279 --> 00:16:38.919
Do you know

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:39.440
my brother, he...

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:41.080
What about your brother?

00:16:42.879 --> 00:16:43.360
It's nothing.

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:44.759
Hurry up and tell me

00:16:44.759 --> 00:16:45.840
about your trip south.

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:48.879
Well, that's a long story.

00:17:54.839 --> 00:17:55.400
Seventh Cousin.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:57.240
What is it?

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:00.279
Nothing.

00:18:02.039 --> 00:18:03.440
I haven't seen you at the palace these past few days.

00:18:04.559 --> 00:18:05.839
I saw you were busy with the Celestial Rite,

00:18:06.279 --> 00:18:07.079
so I didn't disturb you.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:09.359
After the Celestial Rite,

00:18:10.119 --> 00:18:11.640
I will speak to Father about us.

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:12.720
How about that?

00:18:18.519 --> 00:18:19.119
What's wrong?

00:18:22.279 --> 00:18:22.720
Nothing.

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:25.000
His Majesty

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:27.799
probably won't agree to our marriage.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:31.920
If Father doesn't agree,

00:18:33.039 --> 00:18:34.319
I'll find a way to make him agree.

00:18:35.599 --> 00:18:36.920
As long as our hearts are as one,

00:18:37.799 --> 00:18:38.240
everything else

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:39.480
is unimportant.

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:41.799
Really?

00:18:42.799 --> 00:18:43.200
Of course.

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:47.680
A Zi,

00:18:48.559 --> 00:18:49.039
come with me.

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:56.400
A Zi,

00:18:57.640 --> 00:18:58.519
my mother told me

00:18:59.279 --> 00:19:00.359
even without parental consent

00:19:00.799 --> 00:19:01.519
or a matchmaker's words,

00:19:01.799 --> 00:19:03.000
as long as two people truly love each other,

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:04.960
they can still receive heaven's blessing.

00:19:07.079 --> 00:19:07.640
A Zi,

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:11.200
would you be willing to take heaven and earth as witness,

00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:13.160
the sun and moon as our guide,

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:14.960
and become husband and wife with me?

00:19:16.759 --> 00:19:17.519
Why not?

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:31.799
First bow to heaven and earth.

00:19:38.039 --> 00:19:39.079
Second bow to the parents.

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:50.880
Husband and wife bow to each other.

00:20:08.079 --> 00:20:08.680
From now on,

00:20:09.759 --> 00:20:10.880
you are my wife.

00:20:19.079 --> 00:20:19.960
One final step.

00:20:21.519 --> 00:20:22.720
I read in a storybook that

00:20:23.279 --> 00:20:24.160
newlyweds

00:20:25.279 --> 00:20:27.480
bury their wedlock hair under intertwined branches

00:20:28.559 --> 00:20:29.799
to be blessed to stay together in life and death.

00:20:30.079 --> 00:20:30.839
A harmonious union for a hundred years.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:34.200
You read it in a storybook.

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:35.799
How can you believe that?

00:20:37.319 --> 00:20:38.160
Better to believe it's true

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:39.559
than to believe it's false.

00:21:19.319 --> 00:21:20.160
This should do it.

00:21:32.759 --> 00:21:35.480
I wish time could just stop at this moment.

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:40.759
Don't worry.

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:42.880
Things will be better in the future.

00:22:21.680 --> 00:22:22.680
Zixiu sent you.

00:22:23.680 --> 00:22:25.319
Lord Grand Secretary is indeed brilliant.

00:22:25.720 --> 00:22:27.079
At least I'll die knowing the truth today.

00:22:27.440 --> 00:22:27.880
Attack!

00:22:49.079 --> 00:22:50.559
Lord Grand Secretary is truly formidable.

00:22:51.279 --> 00:22:52.079
But no matter how skilled you are,

00:22:52.400 --> 00:22:53.640
you can't save the Fifth Princess now.

00:22:55.240 --> 00:22:55.799
Bring her up.

00:23:11.440 --> 00:23:11.880
A Lan.

00:23:12.799 --> 00:23:13.240
A Lan!

00:23:23.759 --> 00:23:25.599
Why do I suddenly feel so uneasy?

00:24:00.799 --> 00:24:01.400
I'm sorry.

00:24:34.039 --> 00:24:34.480
My Lord.

00:24:35.920 --> 00:24:36.839
Yuwen Rui is dead.

00:24:41.920 --> 00:24:43.079
Didn't you say to spare his life?

00:24:45.720 --> 00:24:48.200
Perhaps the situation was too critical.

00:24:48.440 --> 00:24:50.119
They couldn't afford to hold back.

00:25:01.519 --> 00:25:02.079
My Lord.

00:25:02.839 --> 00:25:03.759
Yuwen Rui is dead.

00:25:04.279 --> 00:25:06.559
It's all gain and no loss for us.

00:25:20.680 --> 00:25:23.400
Tomorrow's affairs are all arranged.

00:25:24.200 --> 00:25:24.920
Rest assured, My Lord.

00:25:25.440 --> 00:25:27.119
Everything will proceed as planned.

00:25:29.960 --> 00:25:31.240
As for the Fourth Princess of Yunmi,

00:25:32.119 --> 00:25:34.319
how does My Lord intend to handle her?

00:25:37.960 --> 00:25:39.000
Post guards to watch her closely.

00:25:40.680 --> 00:25:41.359
Without orders,

00:25:42.240 --> 00:25:43.599
she is not to leave her chambers.

00:25:45.200 --> 00:25:46.079
For tomorrow's Celestial Rite,

00:25:47.319 --> 00:25:48.480
announce that she has caught a chill.

00:25:49.400 --> 00:25:50.000
She is not fit to go out.

00:25:51.480 --> 00:25:51.839
Understood.

00:25:53.640 --> 00:25:54.559
Take good care of her.

00:25:55.839 --> 00:25:56.559
Do not make things difficult for her.

00:25:58.799 --> 00:25:59.200
Yes.

00:26:29.079 --> 00:26:30.079
Where are A Lan and A Zi?

00:26:30.359 --> 00:26:31.160
Why haven't they arrived yet?

00:26:32.319 --> 00:26:33.160
Your Majesty,

00:26:33.440 --> 00:26:34.920
word from the Fourth Princess's quarters is

00:26:35.599 --> 00:26:37.000
she suddenly fell ill with a chill today.

00:26:37.240 --> 00:26:38.039
She is not fit to attend.

00:26:38.559 --> 00:26:40.039
As for the Fifth Princess,

00:26:40.039 --> 00:26:41.400
A Lan has always been fond of play.

00:26:42.000 --> 00:26:43.200
It's not the first time she's been late.

00:26:54.359 --> 00:26:54.799
Princess.

00:26:55.079 --> 00:26:55.960
I've made inquiries.

00:26:56.160 --> 00:26:57.920
Grand Tutor Guan has been staying at his residence these past few days.

00:26:58.079 --> 00:26:58.839
Nothing out of the ordinary.

00:26:59.200 --> 00:27:00.119
He entered the palace this morning

00:27:00.119 --> 00:27:01.720
to make final preparations for the Celestial Rite.

00:27:06.559 --> 00:27:07.119
Princess.

00:27:07.119 --> 00:27:08.079
You must hurry.

00:27:08.079 --> 00:27:09.640
The Celestial Rite has already begun.

00:27:10.000 --> 00:27:11.839
All the masters in the palace, except you and the Fourth Princess,

00:27:12.000 --> 00:27:13.200
have already gone over.

00:27:13.839 --> 00:27:15.000
My elder sister hasn't gone either?

00:27:15.519 --> 00:27:17.039
The Fourth Princess has caught a chill.

00:27:17.240 --> 00:27:18.480
I'm afraid she won't be going today.

00:27:20.359 --> 00:27:22.960
How did she catch a chill out of the blue?

00:27:23.240 --> 00:27:24.680
I know about this matter.

00:27:25.480 --> 00:27:27.319
This morning, I ran into Xiao Liangzi.

00:27:27.440 --> 00:27:28.240
Xiao Liangzi said

00:27:28.400 --> 00:27:29.640
he secretly saw

00:27:29.759 --> 00:27:31.920
the Fourth Princess and Young Master Xiu

00:27:31.920 --> 00:27:33.680
under the peach blossoms in Jingfeng Forest,

00:27:33.839 --> 00:27:34.839
pledging themselves to each other.

00:27:35.400 --> 00:27:37.599
Young Master Xiu also buried their wedlock hair

00:27:37.839 --> 00:27:38.880
under the tree.

00:27:39.359 --> 00:27:39.759
The wind was strong.

00:27:40.200 --> 00:27:41.720
Perhaps that's why the Fourth Princess

00:27:41.720 --> 00:27:42.680
caught a chill.

00:27:44.039 --> 00:27:45.759
Seventh Cousin is quite romantic.

00:27:50.759 --> 00:27:51.279
Nanny.

00:27:51.480 --> 00:27:52.160
This is delicious.

00:27:52.359 --> 00:27:52.880
Try some.

00:27:57.799 --> 00:27:58.720
What is it, Princess?

00:28:27.599 --> 00:28:28.079
Nanny.

00:28:28.640 --> 00:28:29.799
What is this tune called?

00:28:30.359 --> 00:28:31.039
How do you...

00:28:32.200 --> 00:28:32.759
Princess.

00:28:33.240 --> 00:28:34.680
The nanny was originally from Yunze.

00:28:35.039 --> 00:28:37.279
She hums this tune from time to time.

00:28:37.880 --> 00:28:39.880
It might be an old Yunze melody.

00:28:41.039 --> 00:28:42.519
A Yunze melody...

00:28:43.519 --> 00:28:44.079
Tell me.

00:28:45.039 --> 00:28:46.559
Who is this despairing old man?

00:28:47.279 --> 00:28:47.960
You know him.

00:28:48.960 --> 00:28:49.559
Grand Tutor Guan.

00:28:50.799 --> 00:28:52.160
He will, inside the Benevolent Heart Hall,

00:28:52.599 --> 00:28:53.920
dash himself against the imperial desk and die.

00:28:55.839 --> 00:28:56.920
Grand Tutor Guan...

00:28:57.680 --> 00:28:59.079
The Celestial Rite...

00:28:59.960 --> 00:29:00.839
What did you just say?

00:29:02.039 --> 00:29:03.640
I... I just said

00:29:03.759 --> 00:29:05.519
Grand Tutor Guan has been normal these past few days.

00:29:05.759 --> 00:29:06.279
No.

00:29:06.480 --> 00:29:07.200
After that.

00:29:07.960 --> 00:29:08.599
Further back.

00:29:09.000 --> 00:29:09.599
I said

00:29:09.599 --> 00:29:10.920
I ran into Xiao Liangzi this morning.

00:29:11.160 --> 00:29:12.039
Further back.

00:29:14.039 --> 00:29:15.200
The Fourth Princess and Young Master Xiu

00:29:15.200 --> 00:29:16.440
pledged themselves to each other.

00:29:16.440 --> 00:29:18.240
Young Master Xiu also buried their wedlock hair

00:29:18.240 --> 00:29:18.920
under the tree.

00:29:20.200 --> 00:29:21.359
In my homeland,

00:29:22.480 --> 00:29:24.119
on the day a couple marries,

00:29:24.519 --> 00:29:25.640
they take strands of their hair

00:29:25.960 --> 00:29:27.480
and bury them together under intertwined branches

00:29:27.640 --> 00:29:30.119
to pray for a long life together.

00:29:31.559 --> 00:29:32.880
Seventh Cousin...

00:29:33.680 --> 00:29:35.000
Princess, what's wrong?

00:29:35.400 --> 00:29:36.400
During the Celestial Rite,

00:29:37.519 --> 00:29:39.000
isn't Grand Tutor Guan supposed to present

00:29:39.000 --> 00:29:39.839
the Heavenly Water to Father?

00:29:40.039 --> 00:29:40.400
Yes.

00:29:40.640 --> 00:29:41.440
Every year at the Celestial Rite,

00:29:41.680 --> 00:29:42.880
three cups of wine are prepared.

00:29:43.079 --> 00:29:44.039
One is offered to heaven and earth.

00:29:44.200 --> 00:29:45.079
One is offered to the ancestors.

00:29:45.319 --> 00:29:46.000
And the last cup

00:29:46.240 --> 00:29:47.599
is presented to His Majesty by a venerable elder

00:29:47.599 --> 00:29:48.319
to pray for favorable weather

00:29:48.960 --> 00:29:50.799
and peace for our Yunmi.

00:29:50.960 --> 00:29:51.599
For national prosperity and people's safety.

00:29:52.599 --> 00:29:52.920
Princess?

00:29:52.920 --> 00:29:53.319
Princess!

00:29:53.319 --> 00:29:53.880
Where are you going?

00:31:13.799 --> 00:31:14.319
Your Majesty!

00:31:34.200 --> 00:31:36.119
Father, don't drink it!

00:31:38.839 --> 00:31:39.279
What...